API.md L2 and L10: a package that holds a broken declaration gets its findings and no fix, since canon edit refuses every rename in it.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a

record Broken {
  dwA: Nowhere
}

record Sound {
  dwB: Int
}
-- findings.txt --
warning[W0001]  a/a.canon:8:3
  field dwB keeps the legacy prefix dw in its Canon name: rename it b (canon rename keeps the old wire name with @json where a load or a data emit reads the field)

0 errors, 1 warning in 1 package (…)
